== 1. the mark in the site
site/logo.png  121589 bytes  93a050d109601ac5962121f12cac5ce3afbfc1423a31024599c63e2a944ada1f
expected       121589 bytes  626654acf4cc90b4b571c9ef49d1e002b60289aaabbb77db4985401e5d766fb9
DIGEST MISMATCH  the page's mark is not the pinned file
sibling        /workspace/ambrogio/v2/api/android-chrome-512x512.png is not here (a runner carries this repository only): the pinned digest above is the whole check
PROGETTO.md    names the same digest
== 2. the markup, on the five pages
pages          5 of 5 carry the file's own 512x512
== 3. the drawn height the stylesheet states
logo drawn     40 px tall (and as wide), expected 40
